  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The development, by\r\nreason of the excessive number of bedrooms and occupants on this site, and the\r\nlack of adequate communal living space to service the needs of the future\r\noccupiers would provide substandard living accommodation for existing/ future\r\noccupiers of the site, and impact on the amenity of neighbouring properties due\r\nto over-intensification of the site to the detriment of their living\r\nconditions. The development is thereby contrary to the high-quality design\r\naspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policies D3.D(7),\r\n(9) and (10) of The London Plan (2021), Policies DM1 A, DM1 C, DM1 D (f), (g),\r\n(h), (i) and DM30 A (b) and (c) of the Harrow Development Management Policies\r\nLocal Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
